{\bigl[(\ln y-\ln2)/(y-2)\bigr]^2}
\frac{\sum_{k=1}^n k^2}{\sqrt{n^6+n^2}}
\le \sum_{k=1}^n\frac{k^2}{\sqrt{n^6+kn}}
